  "body": [
    {
      "_key": "en",
      "_type": "object",
      "value": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000001",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000000",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Only In St.Catherine"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000003",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "In the heart of Egypt’s serene landscape lies St. Catherine, a locale not solely unique for its breathtaking scenery but also for the enriching cultural immersion it offers. A visit to St. Catherine transcends typical travel experiences, especially when it involves the warm hospitality of the local Bedouin communities."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000005",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "As twilight descends over the rugged mountains, a traditional gathering around a crackling open fire becomes an almost mystical experience. Whether nestled in the sandy expanses of the desert or in the quaint garden of the Bedouin Camp & Guesthouse, each setting casts its own enchanting spell. Here, under the canopy of stars, you are invited to partake in an authentic Bedouin feast. The spread ranges from simple, yet flavorful, local fare to more robust, hearty dishes, all accompanied by an endless flow of aromatic teas, rich coffees, and herbal infusions that tantalize the senses."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000007",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "A mere stone’s throw from St. Catherine, the Blue Desert awaits, its vast open plains punctuated by uniquely painted boulders—a whimsical touch added by a Belgian artist. As the sun dips below the horizon, painting the sky in hues of gold and crimson, a short car ride brings you to this captivating landscape. Here, amidst the serene beauty of nature, a campfire is kindled, heralding the beginning of an unforgettable evening."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000009",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000008",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "As the fire flickers and dances, the air fills with the heady aroma of freshly brewed tea, coffee, and herbal concoctions, alongside the sizzle of a meal being lovingly prepared over open flames. The highlight of the evening is the vibrant Bedouin party, resounding with the melodious strums of traditional Simsymia or Uud music. This soulful celebration, rich in cultural heritage, stretches into the night, offering a unique window into the heart of Bedouin life and traditions."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "St. Catherine’s allure lies not just in its natural beauty or historical significance, but in these intimate, shared moments that connect you to the land and its people. It’s an experience that transcends the ordinary, offering a glimpse into a way of life that has remained unchanged for centuries."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000c",
          "_pendingImage": "https://travel2egypt.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Mosque_MG_0823.jpg",
          "_type": "image",
          "alt": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "Close-up of an ancient, weathered minaret against a clear blue sky"
            }
          ],
          "caption": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "The enduring beauty of a minaret, sculpted by time and the elements"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000000d",
          "_pendingImage": "https://travel2egypt.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Saint-Catherine-City-Egypt-Tours-Portal.jpg",
          "_type": "image",
          "alt": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "Mural depicting Saint Catherine City with mountains, a camel, and cultural icons."
            }
          ],
          "caption": [
            {
              "_key": "en",
              "value": "aint Catherine City, Egypt: A vibrant mural showcasing the city's unique blend of culture and nature at the gateway to Sinai's rugged beauty"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_key": "es",
      "_type": "object",
      "value": [
        {
          "_key": "000000000001",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "fnaojhfc3qex",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Sólo en "
            },
            {
              "_key": "szgqya5bhwgq",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "dql82k2zv4zc"
              ],
              "text": "Santa Catalina"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "dql82k2zv4zc",
              "_type": "internalLink",
              "reference": {
                "_ref": "wp-page-58925",
                "_type": "reference"
              }
            }
          ],
          "style": "h2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000008",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000002",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "En el corazón del sereno paisaje de "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000004",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000003"
              ],
              "text": "Egipto"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000005",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " se encuentra Santa Catalina, un lugar no sólo único por sus impresionantes paisajes, sino también por la enriquecedora inmersión cultural que ofrece."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000007",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Una visita a Santa Catalina trasciende las típicas experiencias de viaje, especialmente cuando implica la cálida hospitalidad de las comunidades beduinas locales."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000003",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "http://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viajes-de-egipto/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "http://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viajes-de-egipto/",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000013",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000009",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "A medida que el crepúsculo desciende sobre las escarpadas montañas, una reunión tradicional alrededor de una crepitante hoguera se convierte en una experiencia casi mística."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Ya sea en las extensiones arenosas del desierto o en el pintoresco jardín del Campamento y Casa de Huéspedes Beduinos, cada escenario lanza su propio hechizo encantador."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Aquí, bajo el cielo estrellado, te invitamos a participar en un auténtico festín beduino."
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "El menú incluye desde platos "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000011",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000010"
              ],
              "text": "locales"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000012",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " sencillos pero sabrosos hasta otros más contundentes y sustanciosos, todo ello acompañado de un sinfín de tés aromáticos, ricos cafés e infusiones de hierbas que embriagan los sentidos."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/7-cosas-inolvidables-que-hacer-en-aswan/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/blog/7-cosas-inolvidables-que-hacer-en-aswan",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000001c",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000014",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "A tiro de piedra de Santa Catalina, te espera el Desierto Azul, con sus vastas llanuras salpicadas de rocas pintadas de forma única, un toque caprichoso añadido por un artista belga."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000015",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000016",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Mientras el sol se oculta en el horizonte, pintando el cielo con tonos dorados y carmesí, un corto trayecto en coche te lleva a este cautivador paisaje."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000017",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000018",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Aquí, en medio de la serena belleza de la naturaleza, se enciende "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000019"
              ],
              "text": "una hoguera que"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001b",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " anuncia el comienzo de una velada inolvidable."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000019",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/oasis-de-siwa-una-aventura-epica-eterna/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/blog/oasis-de-siwa-una-aventura-epica-eterna",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "00000000002b",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Mientras el fuego parpadea y baila, el aire se llena del embriagador aroma del té, el café y los brebajes de hierbas recién hechos, junto con el chisporroteo de "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000001f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "00000000001e"
              ],
              "text": "una comida preparada con esmero sobre las"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000020",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " llamas."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000021",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000022",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "El momento culminante de la noche es la vibrante fiesta beduina, "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000024",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000023"
              ],
              "text": "que resuena con los"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000025",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " melodiosos rasgueos de la música tradicional Simsymia o Uud."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000026",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000027",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Esta conmovedora celebración, rica en patrimonio cultural, se prolonga hasta bien entrada la noche, ofreciendo una ventana única al corazón "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000029",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000028"
              ],
              "text": "de la"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002a",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " vida y las tradiciones beduinas."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000001e",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/el-tiempo-en-egipto/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/guide/rosetta-rasheed/el-tiempo-en-rosetta-rashid-y-la-mejor-epoca-para-visitarla",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000023",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/que-incluyen-los-paquetes-de-crucero-por-el-nilo/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/blog/que-incluyen-los-paquetes-de-crucero-por-el-nilo",
              "newTab": false
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000028",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/guia-de-viaje-de-guiza/la-mastaba-de-ptahshepses-en-abusir/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/guide/guiza/la-mastaba-de-ptahshepses-en-abusir",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "000000000035",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "00000000002c",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "El encanto de Santa Catalina no reside sólo en su belleza natural o su importancia histórica, sino en esos momentos íntimos y compartidos "
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002e",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "que te conectan con la tierra"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000002f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " y sus gentes."
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000030",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "\n"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000031",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Es "
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000033",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "000000000032"
              ],
              "text": "una experiencia que"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000034",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " trasciende lo ordinario, ofreciendo una visión de una forma de vida que ha permanecido inalterada durante siglos."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_key": "000000000032",
              "_pendingInternalRef": {
                "sourceLocale": "en",
                "wpUrl": "https://travel2egypt.org/es/los-coptos-de-egipto-guardianes-de-una-antigua-fe/"
              },
              "_type": "externalLink",
              "href": "/es/blog/los-coptos-de-egipto-guardianes-de-una-antigua-fe",
              "newTab": false
            }
          ],
          "style": "normal"
        },
